<title>USA: SBC, partner seek stake in Telkom of South Africa.</title>
<headline>SBC, partner seek stake in Telkom of South Africa.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>SBC Communications Inc and Telekom Malaysia Bhd said Monday they signed an agreement to pursue jointly a share in South Africa's Telkom SA Ltd.</p>
<p>The companies said they have been short-listed for the South Africa government's planned sale of up to 30 percent of Telkom, the state-owned telecommunications company.  </p>
<p>In December 1995, the South African government said it would seek a strategic equity partner for Telkom. A final decision will be made by April 1, 1997, the companies said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
